      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹57.42 (vs ₹52.71 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹57.42 (up from ₹52.71 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹1.67b (up 7.4% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹258.4m (up 8.9% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 16% (in line with FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 16% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 17% per year.",
